[ChapterName "07 · The stalemate laboratory"]

{ White to move. Two neighboring queen moves write opposite endings. First deliberately build a stalemate with Qb6; then rewind and find checkmate. This laboratory asks you to understand the cage well enough to create it or avoid it. } 1. Qb6 { No check, no legal move: stalemate. You have built the cage. [%csl Ga8,Rb8,Rb7,Ra7] } ( 1. Qb7# { Check and no legal escape: checkmate! The white king protects the queen on b7. One square changes the ending. } ) *
